  list_widgets:
    kind: read
    deadline: 30s
    http: {method: GET, host: "{from-target}", path: /widgets}
    record:
      over: $.body.result
      identity: $.id
      fields: {id: $.id}

CAPABILITIES        http
BOUND               none
RECORD CARDINALITY  series
RECORD IDENTITY     $.id
REPEATABILITY       repeatable
DEADLINE            30s
CONCURRENCY LIMIT   1
